KINGDOM_BEAST:
Huntsman:
						reduces $blt RES and applies  $vvk on frontline;
						removes  $pos token on backline;
						big AoE DMG on Berserk

Tribewalker:
						applies $blt and  $sts (sometimes  $stn );
						gets $rps ;
						dances between ranks

Tribecaller:
						gives $str $blk Rage, applies $blt $sts on backline;
						applies $vln $sts and +1 $blt debuff on frontline

Rot Claw:
						applies  $vln $hrr $bld $blt ,  $mve knockbacks and $tnt ;
						big AoE DMG on Berserk

KINGDOM_COVEN:
Dedicant:
						starts with $ddg ; ignores $blk when self $stl ; applies  $neg tokens on heroes;
						uses Cauldron to remove  $pos tokens from heroes and to apply  $stl on enemy group

Custode:
						starts with $blk ; has high physical DMG; goes  $mve forward; applies $dze ; attacks deal  $sts if was healed;
						uses Cauldron to damage heroes and to apply  $reg on enemy group

Hateful Virago:
						starts with $ddg+ ; applies $brn ; applies much $blt and $sts on rank 4; may  $mve shuffle heroes;
						uses Cauldron to apply more $brn on heroes

Cauldron:
						helps witches or applies AoE effects on heroes; on death applies $brn and transfers  $neg tokens on adjacent witches;
						being last unit, does harakiri, damaing and $sts -ing heroes

Escalation 3:
						corpses transform to mushrooms preventing healing for heroes;
						witches start battle with additional $ddg+

KINGDOM_CRIMSON:
Cocoon:
						on round 2 if on ranks 1-2 — attacks a hero on backline, +1 $sts and transforms in a bloodsucker (even Banquet if Escalation 2+);
						on death spawns Swarm

Supplicant:
						applies $blt $cmb $sts ; heals self +  $grd someone;
						while alive, buffs all bloodsuckers: higher $bld $blt $brn RES

Esquire:
						starts with $ddg ; ignores $blk ; gets  $ddg $ddg+ $rps ; applies  $cmb ;
						on  $rps goes back, and on backline: heals + gets  $pos tokens +  $mve forward, applying $bld $sts ;
						while alive, buffs all bloodsuckers: higher $bld $blt $brn Piercing

Chevalier:
						starts with $blk ; applies $bld $sts ; goes  $mve back from frontline; $stn heroes with  $cmb and  $mve moves them;
						while alive, buffs all bloodsuckers: more DMG on $bld targets

Banquet:
						AoE DMG on mirrored ranks, applying  $sts $bln $vln $cmb ; penetrates  $cmb hero, getting  $pos tokens and healing, applying  $sts $bld , also moving to front;
						once per battle may summon 1-2 Swarms;
						while alive, buffs all bloodsuckers: more $bld $blt $brn applied and more DUR
